<title>UK: Dexia Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Dexia Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.  BORROWER   DEXIA HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *3.7	MATURITY    28.NOV.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    29.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING    BERLIN    DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 28.NOV.97 THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR STEPS-UP TO</p>
<p>		 4.55 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBREIF SERIES 597.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
